 Gate Evening, con animazioni all’accesso e modalità screen saver.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macos-golden-gate-day-wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-golden-gate-day-wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16938,\"date\":\"2026-08-14T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-14T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-apre-houston-advanced-manufacturing-center-mac-mini\",\"title\":\"Apple apre ad Houston un Advanced Manufacturing Center e prepara la produzione del Mac mini\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha inaugurato ad Houston un Advanced Manufacturing Center da 20.000 metri quadrati, collegato alla produzione di server AI. Il centro avvierà anche la produzione del Mac mini nel corso dell’anno.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-houston-manufacturing-facility-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-houston-manufacturing-facility-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16879,\"date\":\"2026-08-12T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-12T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"imac-pannello-oled-strato-extra-anti-burn-in\",\"title\":\"iMac con pannello OLED: possibile strato extra anti screen burn-in\",\"excerpt\":\"Un possibile aggiornamento per i futuri iMac con display OLED includerebbe uno strato aggiuntivo per ridurre il rischio di screen burn-in.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/m4-imac-side-view-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"m4-imac-side-view\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\"